.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-admin-users-social-connections - Read verified social evidence for risk review


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad admin users social-connections [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Read stored social verification evidence, including current-link state,
verification timestamps, audience history, and shared identities. Historical
verification is not proof of a current connection. Missing counts are unknown,
not zero. This read-only command does not refresh providers, score eligibility,
mark a seller compliant, or release payouts. When available, it also shows the
latest dated historical SHADOW evaluation, not current eligibility or payout
authorization. Missing or null evaluations mean no snapshot was supplied, not a
negative score. --plain keeps connection-only rows; use --json or --jq for the
shadow snapshot.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--email\fP=""
	User email

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for social-connections

.PP
\fB--user-id\fP=""
	User external ID

.PP
\fB--username\fP=""
	User username


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
